# Allow only application code and checked-in reference inputs into the context.
**
!Dockerfile
!serve.py
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY.md
!requirements-timestamps.txt
!apps/
!apps/**
!backend/
!backend/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!data/
!data/reference/
!data/reference/**
!data/lessons/
!data/lessons/*.json

# Exclude hidden files, local dependencies and caches even in allowed folders.
**/.*
**/__pycache__
**/node_modules
**/models
**/local-recordings
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.pyc
**/*.partial
